  "findings": [
    "Sixteen complete erosion job bodies match the preceding checked client after address normalization, preserving registers, immediate values, internal branches, available call symbols and floating-point/SIMD constant bytes. Unresolved external calls require separate review.",
    "The active erosion wrapper calls 0x1813dd5f0. The active material wrapper calls 0x1833ce9f0. Program coefficients and job scheduling retain the reviewed preceding kernels. Changed static TerrainMeta/WaterSystem field locations and CRC state layout are runtime dependencies.",
    "The selected scene orders erosion 611 at 11, rivers 576 at 12 and erosion splatting 653 at 73.",
    "Cliff classification protects mask 8389632 and sets Cliff bit 2 for slope greater than 30 or rock greater than 0.4. Its radius-one neighbor callback sets Cliffside bit 4194304. KeepExisting is false in both scene stages 490 and 614.",
    "Clutter dilation uses radius three, decor mask 512 and clutter mask 16777216.",
    "PrefabPriority.Default is literal 2. The comparison reads authored priorities through the parameter wrapper with default 2, compares priority descending and count ascending. Object member locations changed to 136 and 72 respectively.",
    "TerrainPlacement dispatch checks WaterMap at offset 294 and water texture at 360, then invokes vtable offset 1336. Monument slot 64 targets the 16-byte return stub at 0x180860be0."
  ],
